5. `The attacker established multiple persistence mechanisms. What is set as the name of the earliest one created?`
	1. Reading through the logs again, we notice a `schtasks` was created under `SysHelper Update`, I didn't notice this at first so i missed it, but this is the first persistent mechanism.
```powershell
C:\Windows\System32\cmd.exe cmd.exe /Q /c schtasks /create /tn "SysHelper Update" /tr "powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -WindowStyle Hidden -File C:\Users\Werni\Appdata\Local\JM.ps1" /sc minute /mo 2 /ru SYSTEM /f 1&gt; \127.0.0.1\ADMIN$__1756076432.886685 2&gt;&amp;1
```
- Flag #5 -> `SysHelper Update`

