13. `What is the MITRE ATT&CK ID associated with the previous technique used by the attacker to pivot to the internal system?`
	1. We first visit the page https://attack.mitre.org/ and then `Ctrl + F` and search for proxy. 
	2. There are 4 subsections, but we know its `internal`. The ID for internal proxies is `T1090.001` this is the flag
- Flag #13 -> `T1090.001`
